{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T16:51:42Z","input_tokens":27460,"cache_read_tokens":94615,"output_tokens":19581,"thinking":"Initial focus is on the `index.html` header, aiming for a high-end enterprise/fintech aesthetic. Design considerations include a dark or clean glass appearance. Will integrate a badge with a glowing emerald dot or gold/amber accent, brand name (\"GourmetLedger\" / \"Control de Crédito & Cobranza\"), and business name subtitle. A date and time widget (e.g., \"Jueves, 29 de Octubre 2026\") and quick action primary buttons (\"+ Nuevo Fiado\", \"+ Registrar Abono\") will be added.\n\n\nConsidering the layout of the primary dashboard elements: KPI cards will display financial overviews; a pill navigation will enable easy switching between different functional areas; the 'Comensales y Cuentas' view will provide user management with search and filter functionality. The 'Anotar Fiado' section will offer a quick input for customer debts. The goal is to provide a comprehensive, intuitive, and modern financial management interface.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\" class=\"h-full\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>GourmetLedger &bull; Control Profesional de Créditos y Cobranza</title>\n  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-slate-900 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- ================= BARRA SUPERIOR EJECUTIVA ================= -->\n  <header class=\"bg-white border-b border-slate-200/80 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-xs no-print\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      \n      <!-- Fila Superior: Marca, Negocio y Acciones Principales -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between h-16 sm:h-20 gap-4\">\n        \n        <!-- Identidad de Marca y Restaurante -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3.5\">\n          <div class=\"w-11 h-11 bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-slate-800 relative\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <path d=\"M18 2v6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3 3 3 0 0 1-3-3V2\"/><path d=\"M15 2v10\"/><path d=\"M15 22v-8\"/><path d=\"M6 2v20\"/><path d=\"M3 2v6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V2\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 -right-0.5 w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-white rounded-full\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <h1 id=\"header-business-name\" class=\"font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight\">\n                Control de Créditos\n              </h1>\n              <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-md text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">POS Food</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Gestión Contable de Fiados, Cuentas y Cobranza</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Botones de Acción Inmediata -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <button onclick=\"switchTab('consumos')\" class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold transition-all\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-700\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 2v6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3 3 3 0 0 1-3-3V2\"/><path d=\"M15 2v10\"/><path d=\"M15 22v-8\"/><path d=\"M6 2v20\"/></svg>\n            <span>Anotar Fiado</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button onclick=\"switchTab('abonos')\" class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 border border-emerald-200/80 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold transition-all\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n            <span>Registrar Abono</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button onclick=\"openModal('modal-add-client')\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold shadow-xs transition-all\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n            <span>Nuevo Comensal</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Barra de Navegación de Pestañas (Segmented Controls) -->\n      <nav class=\"flex space-x-1 border-t border-slate-100 py-2.5 overflow-x-auto text-xs font-semibold\">\n        <button id=\"nav-btn-clientes\" onclick=\"switchTab('clientes')\" class=\"nav-tab-btn px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap shadow-xs\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n          <span>Comensales y Cuentas</span>\n          <span id=\"nav-badge-debtors\" class=\"ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-rose-500 text-white rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold\">0</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button id=\"nav-btn-consumos\" onclick=\"switchTab('consumos')\" class=\"nav-tab-btn px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors font-medium\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 2v6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3 3 3 0 0 1-3-3V2\"/><path d=\"M15 2v10\"/><path d=\"M15 22v-8\"/><path d=\"M6 2v20\"/></svg>\n          <span>Anotar Fiado (Consumo)</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button id=\"nav-btn-abonos\" onclick=\"switchTab('abonos')\" class=\"nav-tab-btn px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors font-medium\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n          <span>Registrar Abono / Pago</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button id=\"nav-btn-reportes\" onclick=\"switchTab('reportes')\" class=\"nav-tab-btn px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors font-medium\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"/><path d=\"M16 8h-8\"/><path d=\"M16 12h-8\"/><path d=\"M12 16h-4\"/></svg>\n          <span>Reporte de Cobranza</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button id=\"nav-btn-configuracion\" onclick=\"switchTab('configuracion')\" class=\"nav-tab-btn px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors font-medium\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Ajustes & Respaldo</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- ================= DASHBOARD & CONTENIDO PRINCIPAL ================= -->\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 sm:py-8 flex-1 w-full no-print\">\n\n    <!-- KPI CARDS EJECUTIVOS (TABLERO FINANCIERO) -->\n    <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-7\">\n      \n      <!-- Card 1: Total Deuda Pendiente -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs kpi-card\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Total por Cobrar</span>\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center border border-rose-100\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"stat-total-debt\" class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-rose-600 font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">Q. 0.00</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>\n          <span id=\"stat-debtors-count\" class=\"font-medium text-slate-700\">0 deudores activos</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card 2: Total Recaudado -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs kpi-card\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Total Recaudado</span>\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center border border-emerald-100\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"stat-total-paid\" class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">Q. 0.00</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n          <span class=\"font-medium text-slate-700\">Abonos y liquidaciones</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card 3: Promedio de Deuda por Comensal -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs kpi-card\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Ticket Promedio Deuda</span>\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center border border-indigo-100\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"stat-avg-debt\" class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">Q. 0.00</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500\">Por comensal con saldo pendiente</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card 4: Seguridad y Estado de Cartera -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs kpi-card\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Estado de Cartera</span>\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800\">100% Almacenado</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>\n          <span>Base de datos local activa</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 1: COMENSALES Y CUENTAS ================= -->\n    <section id=\"tab-content-clientes\" class=\"tab-content\">\n      <!-- Toolbar de Búsqueda, Filtro y Switch de Vista -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs mb-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3.5 items-center justify-between\">\n        \n        <!-- Input de Búsqueda -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full sm:w-96\">\n          <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-slate-400\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <input \n            type=\"text\" \n            id=\"search-clients-input\" \n            placeholder=\"Buscar por nombre, oficina o teléfono...\" \n            class=\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:border-slate-900 bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white transition-all\"\n          >\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto justify-between sm:justify-end\">\n          \n          <!-- Filtro de estado -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <select id=\"filter-clients-status\" class=\"px-3 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 shadow-xs cursor-pointer\">\n              <option value=\"debtors\" selected>Pendientes de Cobro</option>\n              <option value=\"all\">Todos los Comensales</option>\n              <option value=\"cleared\">Cuentas al Día</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Switcher de Vista: Cuadrícula / Tabla -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 text-xs\">\n            <button id=\"view-toggle-grid\" onclick=\"setClientViewMode('grid')\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-xs text-slate-800 border border-slate-200 transition-all\" title=\"Vista Cuadrícula\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n            <button id=\"view-toggle-table\" onclick=\"setClientViewMode('table')\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 transition-all\" title=\"Vista Tabla Ejecutiva\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"3.01\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"3.01\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"3.01\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Contenedor Principal de Clientes (Grid o Tabla dinámico) -->\n      <div id=\"clients-view-container\" class=\"animate-slide-up\">\n        <!-- Render dinámico desde JavaScript -->\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 2: ANOTAR FIADO (CONSUMO) ================= -->\n    <section id=\"tab-content-consumos\" class=\"tab-content hidden animate-slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-9 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        \n        <div class=\"mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 2v6a3 3 0 0 1-3 3 3 3 0 0 1-3-3V2\"/><path d=\"M15 2v10\"/><path d=\"M15 22v-8\"/><path d=\"M6 2v20\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span>Anotar Consumo Fiado</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Asigna el platillo o menú servido para acumularlo en el saldo del cliente.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form id=\"credit-form\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <!-- Selección de Cliente -->\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"credit-client-id\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n              Comensal / Cliente *\n            </label>\n            <select id=\"credit-client-id\" required class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none bg-white\">\n              <!-- Opciones dinámicas -->\n            </select>\n            <div id=\"credit-client-preview\" class=\"mt-2.5 hidden\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Atajos rápidos de platillos comunes -->\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Atajos de platillos frecuentes:</span>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs\">\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"setQuickDish('1x Menú Ejecutivo del día', 30.00)\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50/80 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 font-semibold transition-all\">\n                🍱 Menú Ejecutivo (Q. 30)\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"setQuickDish('2x Menú Ejecutivo del día', 60.00)\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50/80 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 font-semibold transition-all\">\n                🍱 2x Menú Ejecutivo (Q. 60)\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"setQuickDish('1x Desayuno Completo + Café', 25.00)\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50/80 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 font-semibold transition-all\">\n                ☕ Desayuno + Café (Q. 25)\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"setQuickDish('Comida corrida con agua fresca', 25.00)\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50/80 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 font-semibold transition-all\">\n                🍲 Comida Corrida (Q. 25)\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"setQuickDish('1x Refresco / Bebida', 8.00)\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all\">\n                🥤 Bebida (Q. 8)\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Detalle de lo consumido -->\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"credit-description\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n              Detalle del Consumo (Platillos / Bebidas) *\n            </label>\n            <input \n              type=\"text\" \n              id=\"credit-description\" \n              required \n              placeholder=\"Ej: 2 Menús ejecutivos con pechuga + 1 gaseosa\" \n              class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\"\n            >\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <!-- Monto -->\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"credit-amount\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Monto Total (Quetzales) *\n              </label>\n              <div class=\"relative\">\n                <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center font-bold text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs\">Q.</span>\n                <input \n                  type=\"number\" \n                  id=\"credit-amount\" \n                  step=\"0.01\" \n                  min=\"0.1\" \n                  required \n                  placeholder=\"0.00\" \n                  class=\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono-numbers focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\"\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Categoría -->\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"credit-category\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Tiempo de Comida\n              </label>\n              <select id=\"credit-category\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none bg-white\">\n                <option value=\"Almuerzo\">Almuerzo / Menú del día</option>\n                <option value=\"Desayuno\">Desayuno</option>\n                <option value=\"Cena\">Cena</option>\n                <option value=\"Bebidas\">Solo Bebidas</option>\n                <option value=\"Antojitos\">Antojitos / Extras</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"credit-date\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Fecha\n              </label>\n              <input type=\"date\" id=\"credit-date\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"credit-time\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Hora\n              </label>\n              <input type=\"time\" id=\"credit-time\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pt-3\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-xs shadow-sm transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n              <span>Guardar Consumo en Cuenta del Comensal</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 3: REGISTRAR ABONO / PAGO ================= -->\n    <section id=\"tab-content-abonos\" class=\"tab-content hidden animate-slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-9 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n        \n        <div class=\"mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200/60 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span>Registrar Abono o Liquidación</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Asienta el dinero recibido para descontarlo del saldo deudor del cliente.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form id=\"payment-form\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <!-- Selección de Cliente -->\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"payment-client-id\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n              Comensal que realiza el pago *\n            </label>\n            <select id=\"payment-client-id\" required class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white\">\n              <!-- Opciones dinámicas -->\n            </select>\n            <div id=\"payment-client-preview\" class=\"mt-2.5 hidden\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <!-- Monto abonado -->\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"payment-amount\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Monto Recibido (Quetzales) *\n              </label>\n              <div class=\"relative\">\n                <span class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center font-bold text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs\">Q.</span>\n                <input \n                  type=\"number\" \n                  id=\"payment-amount\" \n                  step=\"0.01\" \n                  min=\"0.1\" \n                  required \n                  placeholder=\"0.00\" \n                  class=\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono-numbers focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none\"\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Método de Pago -->\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"payment-method\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Método de Pago\n              </label>\n              <select id=\"payment-method\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none bg-white\">\n                <option value=\"Efectivo\">Efectivo en Caja</option>\n                <option value=\"Transferencia Banco Industrial (BI)\">Transferencia Banco Industrial (BI)</option>\n                <option value=\"Transferencia Banrural\">Transferencia Banrural</option>\n                <option value=\"Transferencia Móvil / Transfer\">Transferencia Móvil</option>\n                <option value=\"Tarjeta Débito/Crédito\">Tarjeta Débito/Crédito</option>\n                <option value=\"Otro\">Otro</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Nota o Referencia -->\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"payment-notes\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n              Referencia / Comprobante (Opcional)\n            </label>\n            <input \n              type=\"text\" \n              id=\"payment-notes\" \n              placeholder=\"Ej: Transferencia BI ref #98412 o Pagó en barra\" \n              class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none\"\n            >\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"payment-date\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Fecha de Pago\n              </label>\n              <input type=\"date\" id=\"payment-date\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"payment-time\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Hora\n              </label>\n              <input type=\"time\" id=\"payment-time\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-600 focus:outline-none\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pt-3\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-xs shadow-xs transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n              <span>Asentar Abono y Actualizar Saldo</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 4: REPORTE DE COBRANZA ================= -->\n    <section id=\"tab-content-reportes\" class=\"tab-content hidden animate-slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs p-6 sm:p-8 mb-6\">\n        \n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"/><path d=\"M16 8h-8\"/><path d=\"M16 12h-8\"/><path d=\"M12 16h-4\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span>Reporte General de Cobranza</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">\n              Listado consolidado de saldos pendientes para cobro con botón de contacto directo.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Botones de Acción de Reporte -->\n          <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n            <button onclick=\"exportDebtorsToCSV()\" class=\"px-3.5 py-2 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-100 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors border border-emerald-200\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-700\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n              <span>Exportar Excel (CSV)</span>\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"printGeneralReport()\" class=\"px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors shadow-xs\">\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9\"/><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"/><rect width=\"12\" height=\"8\" x=\"6\" y=\"14\"/></svg>\n              <span>Imprimir Reporte</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Banner de Gran Total -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6\">\n          <div class=\"p-5 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-700 uppercase tracking-wider\">Gran Total por Cobrar</p>\n              <p id=\"report-total-sum\" class=\"text-2xl font-black text-rose-600 font-mono-numbers tracking-tight\">Q. 0.00</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-100/80 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">\n              Q.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider\">Personas con Cuenta Activa</p>\n              <p id=\"report-debtors-count\" class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">0 personas</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/80 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tabla de Deudores -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr class=\"bg-slate-50 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase border-b border-slate-200 tracking-wider\">\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center w-12\">#</th>\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5\">Comensal / Ubicación</th>\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5\">Contacto</th>\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5\">Último Consumo</th>\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5\">Saldo Deudor</th>\n                <th class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-right\">Acción</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"report-debtors-tbody\" class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100\">\n              <!-- Render dinámico desde JavaScript -->\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 5: CONFIGURACIÓN Y RESPALDO ================= -->\n    <section id=\"tab-content-configuracion\" class=\"tab-content hidden animate-slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6\">\n\n        <!-- Formulario del Negocio -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n          <div class=\"mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span>Datos del Restaurante / Negocio</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Esta información se imprimirá en los tickets y mensajes para cobrar a tus comensales.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <form id=\"config-form\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div>\n                <label for=\"cfg-business-name\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                  Nombre del Negocio / Comedor\n                </label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"cfg-business-name\" required class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <label for=\"cfg-owner-name\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                  Encargado / Administrador\n                </label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"cfg-owner-name\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <div>\n                <label for=\"cfg-phone\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                  Teléfono / WhatsApp de Cobranza\n                </label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"cfg-phone\" placeholder=\"Ej: 50212345678\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <label for=\"cfg-currency\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                  Símbolo de Moneda\n                </label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"cfg-currency\" placeholder=\"Q., $, S/., €, etc.\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"cfg-payment-info\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Cuentas Bancarias para Transferencias (Aparecen en el Ticket)\n              </label>\n              <textarea id=\"cfg-payment-info\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Ej: Banco Industrial (BI) Cta: 014-4812-990 | Banrural Cta: 3102-4589-12 | Transferencia Móvil\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"cfg-whatsapp-msg\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">\n                Plantilla del Mensaje de WhatsApp\n              </label>\n              <textarea id=\"cfg-whatsapp-msg\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\"></textarea>\n              <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1\">Variables automáticas: {CLIENTE}, {NEGOCIO}, {DETALLES}, {MONEDA}, {TOTAL}, {DATOS_PAGO}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"pt-2 text-right\">\n              <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-xs shadow-xs transition-all\">\n                Guardar Configuración\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Copias de Seguridad y Respaldo -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span>Respaldo y Seguridad de Datos</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Tus datos se guardan de forma privada y local en tu navegador. Puedes exportarlos para guardarlos en tu computadora o pasarlos a otro dispositivo.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n            <button onclick=\"exportFullBackupJSON()\" class=\"p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-2 transition-all\">\n              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-700\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n              <span>Descargar Copia (JSON)</span>\n            </button>\n\n            <label class=\"p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-2 cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-700\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg>\n              <span>Restaurar Copia</span>\n              <input type=\"file\" id=\"input-import-backup\" accept=\".json\" onchange=\"handleImportJSON(event)\" class=\"hidden\">\n            </label>\n\n            <button onclick=\"resetToDemoData()\" class=\"p-4 bg-rose-50/70 hover:bg-rose-100/80 border border-rose-200 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-rose-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-2 transition-all\">\n              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-rose-600\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"1 4 1 10 7 10\"/><path d=\"M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 2.13-9.36L1 10\"/></svg>\n              <span>Restaurar Datos Ejemplo</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ================= FOOTER DISCRETO ================= -->\n  <footer class=\"bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 no-print\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <span>GourmetLedger POS &bull; Control de Créditos y Cobranza</span>\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span> Operando 100% Offline</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- ================= MODAL: NUEVO / EDITAR CLIENTE ================= -->\n  <div id=\"modal-add-client\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl w-full max-w-md p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 animate-slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 mb-4\">\n        <h3 id=\"modal-client-title\" class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm tracking-tight\">Registrar Nuevo Comensal</h3>\n        <button onclick=\"closeModal('modal-add-client')\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 text-xl font-bold leading-none\">&times;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <form id=\"client-form\" class=\"space-y-3.5\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"client-form-id\">\n\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"client-name\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Nombre Completo *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"client-name\" required placeholder=\"Ej: Ing. Carlos Mendoza\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"client-alias\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Apodo / Empresa / Oficina</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"client-alias\" placeholder=\"Ej: Oficina 304 - Edificio Central o Taller\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"client-phone\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Teléfono / WhatsApp de Cobro</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"client-phone\" placeholder=\"Ej: 50212345678\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"client-limit\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Límite de Crédito Opcional (Q.)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"client-limit\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"Ej: 300.00 (0 para sin límite)\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono-numbers focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"client-notes\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Notas / Días de Pago</label>\n          <textarea id=\"client-notes\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Ej: Paga cada quincena puntualmente\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900 focus:outline-none\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-100\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-delete-client\" onclick=\"deleteCurrentClient()\" class=\"hidden px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-50 rounded-xl transition-colors\">\n            Eliminar\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"flex gap-2 ml-auto\">\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeModal('modal-add-client')\" class=\"px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50\">\n              Cancelar\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold hover:bg-slate-800 shadow-xs\">\n              Guardar Comensal\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= MODAL: ESTADO DE CUENTA / TICKET DE COBRO ================= -->\n  <div id=\"modal-billing-report\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/70 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-6 overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl w-full max-w-2xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 my-auto flex flex-col max-h-[95vh] animate-slide-up\">\n      \n      <!-- Encabezado del Modal -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 sm:p-5 border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between no-print\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"/><path d=\"M16 8h-8\"/><path d=\"M16 12h-8\"/><path d=\"M12 16h-4\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm leading-tight\">Estado de Cuenta & Reporte de Cobro</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\">Ticket detallado listo para enviar por WhatsApp o imprimir</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <!-- Selector Ticket POS o Completo -->\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl flex text-xs border border-slate-200\">\n            <button id=\"btn-mode-ticket\" onclick=\"setTicketMode('ticket')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white text-slate-900 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold shadow-xs\">\n              Ticket POS (80mm)\n            </button>\n            <button id=\"btn-mode-full\" onclick=\"setTicketMode('completo')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium\">\n              Carta / Amplio\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <button onclick=\"closeModal('modal-billing-report')\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 text-2xl font-bold ml-2 leading-none\">&times;</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Contenedor del Comprobante (Área Imprimible) -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 sm:p-6 overflow-y-auto flex-1 bg-slate-100/60\">\n        <div id=\"billing-report-content\">\n          <!-- Render dinámico desde JavaScript del ticket -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Barra de Acciones de Cobro -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 sm:p-5 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white rounded-b-3xl flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2.5 no-print\">\n        \n        <button id=\"btn-copy-report\" class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"/></svg>\n          <span>Copiar Mensaje</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <button onclick=\"printBillingReport()\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-xs transition-colors\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"6 9 6 2 18 2 18 9\"/><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"/><rect width=\"12\" height=\"8\" x=\"6\" y=\